        rows = conn.execute(query, (session_id, *sorted(finding_ids))).fetchall()","start_line":1156,"end_line":1163,"thinking":"While the parameterized query is safe from SQL injection, the number of placeholders is unbounded. SQLite's default SQLITE_MAX_VARIABLE_NUMBER is 999 (or 32766 in newer versions). In a session with thousands of findings in fixed-pending-verification state, this could exceed the limit and crash. Batching prevents this edge case.","imprecise":false}

