    return {str(row["finding_id"]): FindingState(str(row["state"])) for row in rows}","start_line":1151,"end_line":1163,"thinking":"Same encapsulation issue as the finalization SQL. The CLI should not be constructing SQL queries directly; it should delegate to SessionStore methods. This raw SQL also appears alongside other similar raw queries in _ready_findings (line 1578) and _findings (line 2127) and _status (line 2087).","imprecise":false}

